## Honest caveat
100% is on Gen 1, whose common verb forms (vqp/vqw/vqi/vhp…) are the 98–99%-pure entries in the table. The mapping is universal so it should generalize, but if you want a clean **held-out** confirmation (run the mechanism on a book whose outputs we *don't* have, then score), that costs opus for fresh model outputs.

## Where survey5 stands now
WLC-only source + 09xxx bridge + morph attach = the full SN+morph parity pipeline, single original-language source, ~0 model burden beyond lexical placement.

